              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe I've been making for years &amp; years. The son-in-law always wants a couple jars all to himself! The only difference I have is I add a couple of whole pepperoncinis (or jalapeno peppers) in the bottom of the container 1st. Let the container sit in the refrigerator for the full 5 days to kick up the heat..."
